flowchart LR
  Device[Device file or microphone] --> Memory[Browser memory and preview]
  Memory --> Inline[Inline API body]
  Memory --> Blob[Optional transient public Blob]
  Link[User direct URL] --> Guard[Validated server download]
  Cookie[Personal key cookie on device] --> Resolve[Server effective key resolution]
  Env[Operator environment] --> Resolve
  Defaults[Tracked reversible defaults - risk] --> Resolve
  Resolve --> Provider[External provider processing]
  Inline --> Provider
  Guard --> Provider
  Blob --> Provider
  Provider --> Response[Normalized response]
  Response --> Text[Browser editable text]
  Response --> Segments[Provider timed segments]
  Text --> CopyTXT[Copy and TXT]
  Segments --> SRT[SRT]
  Provider --> Local[Per-process attempt counters]
